+    pull sees every ledger row in [00:00Z, day_req] (default t + 2 s — AFTER the snapshot, as in production); the gap
+    pull sees [floor(prev_t), 00:00Z − 1]. `carrier` overrides the legacy quantity sum (identity tamper only)."""
+    day_req = t + 2.0 if day_req is None else day_req
